1
00:00:00,973 --> 00:00:02,536
Moyshe Gorelik.

2
00:00:04,078 --> 00:00:06,232
nu, eyn zakh vil ikh zogn:

3
00:00:06,323 --> 00:00:09,590
az yidn zaynen geven di beste kemfer.

4
00:00:10,727 --> 00:00:13,522
vos s'zoln nit reydn ale antisemitn,

5
00:00:13,933 --> 00:00:16,289
nor a yid hot gekemft bizl

6
00:00:17,224 --> 00:00:22,330
der letster minut, bizl er hot nor gekent,

7
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:26,440
un dem letste, di letste koyl hot er gehaltn far zikh,

8
00:00:27,028 --> 00:00:30,009
vorem mir hobn gevust, mir, di yidn

9
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:33,486
hobn zeyer shtark gevust vos s'tut

10
00:00:33,981 --> 00:00:37,090
der Natsi oyb er khapt a yidn.

11
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,510
es zaynen geflien

12
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:42,429
oyf undz papirlekh...

13
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,651
oyf rusish heyst LISTOVKes...

14
00:00:44,651 --> 00:00:48,700
flegn flien papirlekh fun ⟨z-⟩ aeroplanen,

15
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,726
itster geven azelkhe SNARYADn

16
00:00:50,726 --> 00:00:54,968
velkhe flegn zikh oyfraysn un va- un fun dortn flegn aroysloyfn papirlekh.

17
00:00:55,108 --> 00:00:57,262
flegt shteyn in zey ongeshribn,

18
00:00:57,623 --> 00:00:59,220
"UBEY ZHIDA,"

19
00:01:01,875 --> 00:01:03,489
"⟨tse⟩harget dem yidn,"

20
00:01:04,052 --> 00:01:07,775
"ZAKHVATI EGO DOKUMENTY," "khap zayne dokumentn,

21
00:01:08,575 --> 00:01:13,060
nem dem papirl, shtel avek oyf der vintovke, oyfn shtik,

22
00:01:13,772 --> 00:01:18,870
farkhap mit zikh a, dos, a, a KOTELOK mit a lefl,

23
00:01:19,392 --> 00:01:21,557
mir veln dir dortn gut kormenen,

24
00:01:21,557 --> 00:01:23,346
un gey iber tsu undz."

25
00:01:23,346 --> 00:01:26,827
azelkhe papirlekh flegn flien, oto di o,

26
00:01:26,935 --> 00:01:29,930
 di onitshes dem NEMTS⟨'es⟩

27
00:01:29,930 --> 00:01:35,096
flegn haltn in eyn, in eyn varfn flegt er oyf undz oto dos kedey agitirn.

28
00:01:35,457 --> 00:01:36,953
"⟨tse⟩harget dem yidn!"

29
00:01:37,009 --> 00:01:39,517
un flegt shteyn ongerisevet a yid,

30
00:01:39,625 --> 00:01:42,184
flegt er zayn ongerisevet mit grobe lipn,

31
00:01:42,578 --> 00:01:45,663
mit groyse oysgelupete oygn,

32
00:01:45,663 --> 00:01:48,258
mit groyse evern azelkhe.

33
00:01:48,619 --> 00:01:49,772
ir farshteyt?

34
00:01:49,772 --> 00:01:52,680
ot. un er shteyt mit a groyser nahayke

35
00:01:52,753 --> 00:01:56,645
oyf eynike papirlekh, un er shlogt dem g- dem poyer.

36
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:59,666
er shlogt, un der poyer shlept kletser,

37
00:01:59,740 --> 00:02:01,522
un der yid shteyt un shlogt.

38
00:02:01,765 --> 00:02:05,840
oder es vayzt zikh a blonde poyerte,

39
00:02:06,085 --> 00:02:07,665
VRODE a sheyne,

40
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:11,532
un es shteyt a yid a mieser mit oysgelupete oygn,

41
00:02:11,532 --> 00:02:14,384
mit dem noz mit zaynem epes...

42
00:02:14,384 --> 00:02:17,076
bay a NEGR gor nito azelkhe grobe lipn,

43
00:02:17,076 --> 00:02:18,887
mit azelkhe evern,

44
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:21,839
un er, mi- mit a liser kop on hor,

45
00:02:22,217 --> 00:02:24,016
un mit a grobn boykh,

46
00:02:24,073 --> 00:02:30,640
un er shteyt un er khapt arumet, a poyerte,

47
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,336
un s'shteyt ongeshribn,

48
00:02:32,427 --> 00:02:36,990
"ZHIDY NASHIKH ZHЁN RAZVRASHCHAYUT!"

49
00:02:37,033 --> 00:02:39,372
"di yidn undzere vayber,

50
00:02:39,615 --> 00:02:43,152
 RA-, RAZVRASHCHAen zey!"

51
00:02:43,581 --> 00:02:47,950
un keynem hot nisht gevust az du bist a yid yetst, in di...?

52
00:02:46,399 --> 00:02:49,830
me hot gevust. in CHAST' hot men gevust.

53
00:02:48,306 --> 00:02:50,480
⟨aha⟩, aha, aha.

54
00:02:49,830 --> 00:02:55,410
GORELIK MIKHAIL GURGENOVICH..., MIKHAIL BORISOVICH. ikh bin nokh nit geven ⟨G-⟩ GURGENOVICH.

55
00:02:55,225 --> 00:02:56,012
⟨⟩.

56
00:02:55,410 --> 00:02:57,783
GORELIK MIKHAIL BORISOVICH.

57
00:02:58,026 --> 00:03:01,660
s'iz umedum geven ongeshribn di NATSIONAL'NOST'.

58
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:03,930
s'iz do in Amerike nit ongeshribn,

59
00:03:03,930 --> 00:03:06,342
tsum bayshpil, "EVREY." dortn iz geven,

60
00:03:06,342 --> 00:03:08,334
hot zikh gerufn "PYATAYA GRAFA,"

61
00:03:08,334 --> 00:03:12,214
"finfte"... eyns, tsvey, dray, fir... "finfte frage."

62
00:03:12,214 --> 00:03:15,283
di finfte frage iz geven natsyonalitet,

63
00:03:15,677 --> 00:03:17,696
iz ongeshribn "EVREY."

64
00:03:18,192 --> 00:03:20,931
ershtns hob ikh nit ge- ge- bahaltn mayne,

65
00:03:20,931 --> 00:03:24,750
un tsveytns iz,

66
00:03:25,279 --> 00:03:29,000
ikh ho- ikh hob umedum gezogt az ikh bin a yid. UNK andersh,

67
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,432
m'hot dokh ni- un bahaltn ⟨hot men⟩ dos nit gekent.

68
00:03:32,670 --> 00:03:36,376
es iz geven efsher eynike yidn, hobn zikh epes gekent iberdreyen, UNK,

69
00:03:36,737 --> 00:03:41,068
 un undzer FAMILY iz dos nit, nit gevezn aza min mayse.

70
00:03:41,462 --> 00:03:44,970
kurts geredt, mir hot men geheysn...

71
00:03:45,124 --> 00:03:51,310
ale antloyfn, un mir hot men geheysn az ikh zol

72
00:03:51,756 --> 00:03:56,810
f-, z- lebn a brik, lebn a brik

73
00:03:58,033 --> 00:04:02,232
hot men mir geheysn az ikh zol blaybn. UNK mir zaynen untergeforn

74
00:04:02,232 --> 00:04:04,187
mit mayn, batarey.

75
00:04:04,648 --> 00:04:09,780
zaynen mir untergeforn. mir forn oyf, dorem. oyf dorem forn mir,

76
00:04:09,863 --> 00:04:15,960
oyf dorem-VOSTOK, forn mir, iber felder, iber velder.

77
00:04:16,274 --> 00:04:19,828
hot gevart oyf mir NACHAL'NIK SHTABA DIVIZIONA.

78
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:25,320
ot. iz ot der NACHAL'NIK SHTABA DIVIZIONA

79
00:04:25,523 --> 00:04:27,528
hot mir gegebn a bafel

80
00:04:27,528 --> 00:04:29,820
az ikh zol mit mayn batarey

81
00:04:30,417 --> 00:04:34,720
lebn dem brik farnemen,

82
00:04:35,378 --> 00:04:39,740
vi me zogt es oyf rusish, OBORONU, ZANYAL OBОRONU.

83
00:04:39,850 --> 00:04:47,110
dos heyst, ikh zol do, yene, kedey s'zol op- opgeyn

84
00:04:47,110 --> 00:04:49,395
on groyse yesurim

85
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:53,186
yene, yene,

86
00:04:53,186 --> 00:04:55,942
 di gantse, VOYSK,

87
00:04:58,227 --> 00:05:01,528
zol ikh do shteyn un nit durkhlozn keyn tanken.

88
00:05:03,272 --> 00:05:04,599
zey hobn gevust,

89
00:05:05,027 --> 00:05:07,282
az a yid shtelt men avek,

90
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:10,650
vet er shteyn un er vet dos ton.

91
00:05:12,283 --> 00:05:15,213
a yid tor nit araynfaln in gefangenshaft.

92
00:05:15,490 --> 00:05:20,300
un ⟨V,⟩ bikhlal di yidn zaynen geven, antkegn der,

93
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:23,246
der, tsol vos zey zaynen gevezn,

94
00:05:23,404 --> 00:05:27,465
zaynen zey geven fun, mer fun andere felker

95
00:05:27,522 --> 00:05:32,980
in dem protsent zaynen mir geven oyfn front. mer!

96
00:05:33,090 --> 00:05:37,080
vorem in yeder teyl zaynen geven a sakh yidn.

97
00:05:37,714 --> 00:05:43,250
tsum bayshpil, bay mir in batarey iz geven finf yidn.

98
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:47,600
finf yidn. UNK bay mir iz geven,

99
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:53,050
 shoyn vintsiker eyder hundert mentshn. ikh hob gedarft hobn mer eyder hundert, nor es klapt zikh op,

100
00:05:53,050 --> 00:05:59,190
iz geven bay mir finf yidn, un yidn zaynen geven bay mir, poylishe yidn.

101
00:06:00,968 --> 00:06:05,906
bay mir iz farshribn ergets eynike familyes vos, FAMILIES vos ikh gedenk.

102
00:06:06,773 --> 00:06:09,433
nor ikh hob gedarft blaybn shoyn mit tsvey

103
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:13,090
pushkes, un tsvey hob ikh gedarft opshikn.

104
00:06:13,219 --> 00:06:20,370
azoy hot mir ⟨P-⟩, gegebn a bafel der NACHAL'NIK SHTABA fun polk.

105
00:06:21,167 --> 00:06:23,101
nu, bin ikh geblibn

106
00:06:23,597 --> 00:06:27,460
do o. kh'hob zikh farfestikt lebn brik.

107
00:06:27,495 --> 00:06:32,450
draysik meter hobn mir avekgeshtelt eyn pushke do, draysik meter, dortn o.

108
00:06:32,558 --> 00:06:35,119
ot do iz geven a balke, a groyse,

109
00:06:35,119 --> 00:06:38,570
a lange grub, dos heyst dos, vos vaser a andersh mol

110
00:06:38,570 --> 00:06:43,841
klapt dos durkh. iz in feld ot ot azoy o, ahin hob ikh opgeshikt di traktorn,

111
00:06:44,168 --> 00:06:46,879
do hobn mir aropgenumen undzere SNARYADn.

112
00:06:48,235 --> 00:06:54,000
ot. un kh'hob gelozn zikh in gantsn finf un tsvantsik man.

113
00:06:54,917 --> 00:06:56,835
di iberike hob ikh geheysn avekforn.

114
00:06:57,752 --> 00:07:02,530
un ikh hob in yener teyl, velkhe hot gedarft avekforn,

115
00:07:02,798 --> 00:07:07,010
hob ikh geheysn ale yidn zoln avekforn,

116
00:07:08,147 --> 00:07:09,761
un ikh hob gezogt,

117
00:07:10,358 --> 00:07:16,020
"yatn, ir zet, ir zolt, vos s'zol nit zayn,

118
00:07:16,669 --> 00:07:24,720
zolt ir muzn aroysgeyn, nit araynkrikh- nit popaden tsum NEMETS in di hent, tsum Natsi."

119
00:07:24,752 --> 00:07:26,180
zey hobn dos gevust.

120
00:07:27,267 --> 00:07:28,813
zey zaynen avekgeforn.

121
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:31,158
avu zey zaynen...

122
00:07:32,059 --> 00:07:34,415
oys. ⟨ot dos iz shoyn far mir⟩ geblibn shtum.

123
00:07:37,425 --> 00:07:41,260
kh'hob geheysn, me zol grobn akopes,

124
00:07:42,184 --> 00:07:43,815
yederer far zikh.

125
00:07:44,428 --> 00:07:45,940
ikh hob gegebn a bafel.

126
00:07:46,757 --> 00:07:50,801
tsveytns, di ORUDIEs hobn mir a bisl oykhet arumgegrobn.

127
00:07:51,448 --> 00:07:54,680
un ikh hob gekukt in binokl.

128
00:07:54,680 --> 00:08:00,500
un in mitn drinen, es iz, er hot mir gezogt, "akht mit draysik in der fri"... dos iz geven bay der nakht...

129
00:08:01,573 --> 00:08:04,730
dos, "akht mit draysik in der fri,

130
00:08:05,269 --> 00:08:07,153
oyb keyner vet nit zayn...

131
00:08:07,395 --> 00:08:10,848
es ken zayn," zogt er, "undzere teyln hobn zikh farhalt imetser,

132
00:08:10,956 --> 00:08:13,780
undzere, veln darfn ibergeyn.

133
00:08:13,977 --> 00:08:17,076
oder di NEMTSes veln krikhn oyfn brik,

134
00:08:17,503 --> 00:08:19,353
iz vestu shteyn un opklapn,

135
00:08:19,714 --> 00:08:22,863
bizl akht a zeyger mit draysik minut in der fri."

136
00:08:23,663 --> 00:08:26,846
akht a, ot iz shoyn akht mit draysik...

137
00:08:27,088 --> 00:08:31,385
TO EST', akht mit draysik iz nokh nit geven. s'iz geven ergets dortn a zeyger zibn.

138
00:08:32,067 --> 00:08:38,490
iz in binokl ze ikh az es geyen, a teyl mit, soldatn.

139
00:08:38,985 --> 00:08:41,369
geyen zey fanandergetsit,

140
00:08:41,369 --> 00:08:44,145
un me geyt un me zukht.

141
00:08:44,145 --> 00:08:47,090
ikh hob farshtanen az zey zukhn mines fargrobene;

142
00:08:47,090 --> 00:08:50,250
mit azelkhe aparatn geyen zey.

143
00:08:51,102 --> 00:08:54,218
ikh hob gegebn a ⟨k-⟩ a bafel az me zol zey tsulozn

144
00:08:54,696 --> 00:08:56,563
un lozn zey oyfn brik geyn.

145
00:08:57,565 --> 00:09:00,765
zey hobn undz nit gezen. do iz gevoksn kustes.

146
00:09:00,855 --> 00:09:02,244
mir hobn undzere...

147
00:09:02,244 --> 00:09:05,189
s'iz geven kustes antkegn,

148
00:09:05,189 --> 00:09:06,739
oyf dem zayt brik,

149
00:09:07,369 --> 00:09:10,468
un oyf yenem zayt, iz fun eyn zayt hot gevoksn

150
00:09:10,643 --> 00:09:14,147
dortn o,

151
00:09:14,457 --> 00:09:16,965
⟨KUYAKH⟩es, oyf,

152
00:09:17,190 --> 00:09:21,190
ot dos vos me est. veyst, faran, lange,

153
00:09:21,190 --> 00:09:27,450
un kleyninke, vi ruft zikh dos, ⟨KUYAKHI⟩? ETO,

154
00:09:27,450 --> 00:09:30,687
oyf yidish veys ikh gornit. ⟨du veyst⟩ dos, ot in krom iz faran,

155
00:09:30,687 --> 00:09:32,746
farkoyft zikh dray in a dos o,

156
00:09:32,746 --> 00:09:35,392
, kleyninke azoy, me darf es opkokhn,

157
00:09:35,584 --> 00:09:38,390
un me hrizet dos ot azoy o.

158
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:40,365
⟨iz⟩ vaksn zey oyset groyse,

159
00:09:40,365 --> 00:09:45,601
iz fun dem zayt vakst ⟨KUYAKH⟩es, un d- fun dem zayt iz bay, geven kustes,

160
00:09:45,625 --> 00:09:49,736
iz zeen z⟨UNK⟩ zeen mir in veg vi zey geyen ot aher o.

161
00:09:50,299 --> 00:09:57,029
nu, m'iz aroyfgegangen oyfn brik, hob ikh gegebn a, a komande az me zol oysshisn nor in der heykh,

162
00:09:57,029 --> 00:09:59,709
zey tsulozn, vorem kh'hob derzen az s'iz nit keyn NEMTSes;

163
00:09:59,884 --> 00:10:03,910
zeyer, di, di formes zeyere iz nit keyn doytshishe.

164
00:10:06,077 --> 00:10:07,843
zey hobn zikh glaykh dershrokn,

165
00:10:08,372 --> 00:10:14,486
un mir hobn zey azoy gepakt. a fuftsik man hobn mir azoy gepakt. eynike hobn ongehoybn shpringen oyf untn,

166
00:10:14,486 --> 00:10:19,622
eynike azoy, nor zey hobn ar- ar- a- opgevorfn di gever,

167
00:10:19,999 --> 00:10:23,199
un ikh hob gegebn a komande ibergeyn dem brik.

168
00:10:23,323 --> 00:10:25,109
zey zaynen ibergegangen dem brik.

169
00:10:25,109 --> 00:10:28,383
dos iz geven a Ruminer CHAST', a Ruminer,

170
00:10:28,383 --> 00:10:31,799
a Ruminer, gegangen a, a por VZVODn

171
00:10:31,799 --> 00:10:36,001
zaynen gegangen, oystshishtshen di veg fun mines.

172
00:10:36,001 --> 00:10:38,810
zey hobn gezukht mines mit di, ETO.

173
00:10:38,882 --> 00:10:42,841
nu, mir hobn tsugenumen di gever bay zey. kh'hob avekgeshtelt a vakh.

174
00:10:42,882 --> 00:10:44,735
vos, ⟨kh'vel⟩ geyn zey tseshisn?

175
00:10:44,735 --> 00:10:46,132
s'iz dokh nit keyn doytshn.

176
00:10:46,543 --> 00:10:48,886
ikh trakht nokh a rakhmones; a yid iz nit keyn,

177
00:10:48,886 --> 00:10:51,195
a yid iz nit keyn merder!

178
00:10:51,977 --> 00:10:52,966
farshteyst?

179
00:10:53,749 --> 00:11:01,870
ikh hob shoyn gegebn, ot iz shoyn akht mit draysik, kh'hob gegebn a komande, di traktoristn zoln derlangen di traktorn tsu di, pushkes:

180
00:11:01,870 --> 00:11:04,155
⟨o⟩, fartshepen, un mir forn aveket.

181
00:11:04,768 --> 00:11:07,023
vi nor gegebn di komande,

182
00:11:07,468 --> 00:11:11,610
eyner a geshrey gegebn, "TANKI!" es forn tanken.

183
00:11:12,362 --> 00:11:16,777
TANKI iz ⟨a, a⟩ tank iz geven di same ergste zakh dan.

184
00:11:17,442 --> 00:11:21,505
es fort, du farshteyst, aza mashin a groyse. zi fort

185
00:11:21,505 --> 00:11:26,365
mit, ⟨, G-,⟩ GUSENITSes ot azelkhe, veyst, dos iz nit keyn reder, oto dos, ot azoy o.

186
00:11:26,365 --> 00:11:30,513
fort zi mit pushke, mit pushkes un shist, un mit pulemyotn.

187
00:11:30,705 --> 00:11:32,352
forn zeks tanken.

188
00:11:32,950 --> 00:11:35,593
un bay mir iz tsvey ot azelkhe ORUDIEs.

189
00:11:36,460 --> 00:11:38,293
nor zey zeen undz nit.

190
00:11:38,552 --> 00:11:43,136
prav- emes, der, Ruminer ofitser hot undz gezogt az in dem dorf

191
00:11:43,547 --> 00:11:46,185
iz, dislotsirn zikh

192
00:11:46,185 --> 00:11:48,497
zeks tanken gefinen zikh dortn o.

193
00:11:48,497 --> 00:11:53,180
zey esn dortn o, zey fresn, di, di, di N- di doytshn,

194
00:11:53,180 --> 00:11:56,164
un zey, mistame kentik az zey veln forn aher.

195
00:11:57,418 --> 00:11:59,369
azoy az ikh hob nit

196
00:11:59,832 --> 00:12:02,780
gehat keyn tsayt oyf antloyfn,

197
00:12:03,628 --> 00:12:06,170
hob ikh geheysn tsulozn zey neenter.

198
00:12:07,257 --> 00:12:08,803
nito vos tsu ton!

199
00:12:09,889 --> 00:12:12,937
tsu mir iz untergegangen ⟨a p-⟩ por komandirn.

200
00:12:13,011 --> 00:12:15,823
 eyner iz geven bay mir,...

201
00:12:16,842 --> 00:12:23,281
di nemen, me darf dermonen di nemen. bay mir iz, geven bay mir eyner Adaskin, iz er geven a yid,

202
00:12:23,406 --> 00:12:26,710
un es iz geven,

203
00:12:27,827 --> 00:12:30,220
a STARSHIY LEYTENANT KUDIMENKO.

204
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:32,321
iz der KUDIMENKO hot zikh ayngetshepet,

205
00:12:32,321 --> 00:12:34,031
"DAVAYTE UDERЁM!"

206
00:12:34,594 --> 00:12:38,941
zog ikh, "mir, mir kenen nit antloyfn!" er heyst antloyfn.

207
00:12:39,066 --> 00:12:40,579
kurts geredt,

208
00:12:41,513 --> 00:12:47,190
dem, vi zaynen zey geforn, iz fun a mehalekh,

209
00:12:47,190 --> 00:12:49,272
mir hobn ongehoybn in zey shisn

210
00:12:49,272 --> 00:12:51,429
fun a mehalekh fun hundert meter.

211
00:12:51,739 --> 00:12:54,470
ikh hob zey tsugelozn zeyer noent.

212
00:12:55,097 --> 00:12:58,618
iz dem ershtn tank glaykh untergetsundn,

213
00:12:58,708 --> 00:13:01,720
dem tsveytn untergetsundn, dem dritn,

214
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:05,992
der driter tank, hot zayner a SNARYAD arayngefaln tsvishn,

215
00:13:06,015 --> 00:13:10,990
tsvishn di, di fis fun dos o, fun, fun ot der ORUDIE

216
00:13:10,990 --> 00:13:14,446
un geharget dem RASCHЁT, fun dray mentshn glaykh geharget,

217
00:13:14,993 --> 00:13:19,714
un dem NAVODCHIK oykh, ot der vos f- firt on. es shteyt aza min aparat un me darf

218
00:13:19,714 --> 00:13:23,100
in dem aparat onfirn PRYAMOY NAVODKOY.

219
00:13:23,100 --> 00:13:28,959
hob ikh ⟨a-⟩ hob ikh untergeklapt dem, dritn tank.

220
00:13:29,421 --> 00:13:34,159
dernokh dem, a fertn hot untergeklapt di tsveyte ORUDIE. der finfter tank

221
00:13:34,159 --> 00:13:37,720
iz UNK opgeklapt di, di, di GUSENITSes.

222
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,780
der zekster iz antlofn gevorn.

223
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:41,998
er hot zikh fardreyt dort tsvishn di kustes

224
00:13:41,998 --> 00:13:46,047
un iz avek durkhn, dortn iz geven a NIZINe, iz ⟨zi⟩ gevorn oys.

225
00:13:46,047 --> 00:13:49,074
ot azoy zaynen mir poter gevorn, hobn zey gekhapt un antlofn gevorn.

226
00:13:49,823 --> 00:13:56,280
mir zaynen antlofn gevorn un mir forn un mir forn. mir zaynen arayngeforn in a vayter balke, hobn mir opgeforn a sho tsayt.

227
00:13:56,286 --> 00:14:00,212
mir zaynen arayngegangen in a b-... efsher darf ikh reydn vegn dem plen?

228
00:14:00,724 --> 00:14:02,422
aropkrikhn fun deroyf?...

229
00:14:02,884 --> 00:14:08,576
kurts geredt, mir hobn, fun balke iz, hobn mir opgeven dortn a sho tsayt.

230
00:14:08,576 --> 00:14:11,889
a por zaynen antlofn gevorn fun di soldatn.

231
00:14:12,672 --> 00:14:18,670
eyner an ofitser a poyer hot ayngeredt az mir zoln fanandergeyn, ZABROSen di,

232
00:14:18,670 --> 00:14:21,019
di gever un a- un antloyfn,

233
00:14:21,379 --> 00:14:25,153
un ikh mit Adaskinen, mir zaynen yidn, mir hobn dos nit derlozn.

234
00:14:26,442 --> 00:14:30,020
mir hobn zikh gezetst. mir hobn derzen az fun a dorf

235
00:14:30,154 --> 00:14:33,002
zaynen aroysgegangen Ruminer soldatn mit ferd

236
00:14:33,002 --> 00:14:34,805
pashen zey oyfn feld.

237
00:14:34,828 --> 00:14:39,880
hobn di ferd ongehoybn geyn tsu undzer balke, avu mir hobn zikh bahaltn.

238
00:14:40,465 --> 00:14:47,023
hob ikh gegebn a komande antloyfn, farfirn, di traktoristn. mir zaynen antlofn gevorn fun dortn o

239
00:14:47,113 --> 00:14:49,149
un mir hobn geforn vayter.

240
00:14:49,324 --> 00:14:52,676
mir hobn UNK forn, ot iz a veg, forn di doytshn

241
00:14:52,851 --> 00:14:54,920
in der TSENTRAL'Ner gas...

242
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:57,907
in di TSENTRAL'Ne veg. dos iz nit keyn gas — a veg.

243
00:14:57,913 --> 00:15:00,760
in TS-, HIGHWAY.

244
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:03,526
zey forn iber HIGHWAY un mir forn in feld.

245
00:15:03,769 --> 00:15:07,475
fun der vaytn hobn zey nit farshtanen nokh ver mir zaynen.

246
00:15:08,359 --> 00:15:09,480
⟨ir⟩ farshteyt?

247
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:15,721
mir forn, do iz a boyd, un dortn zitsn in boyd di soldatn, ORUDIE. fun der vaytn zet men nit.

248
00:15:15,721 --> 00:15:17,164
in eynem an ort,

249
00:15:17,164 --> 00:15:19,569
mir hobn durkhgeforn noent tsum veg,

250
00:15:19,569 --> 00:15:23,661
iz gevorn epes zeyern a groysn natshalnik a NEMETS

251
00:15:23,661 --> 00:15:29,649
iz gevorn, PODOZRITEL'Ne, m'iz gevorn, "v- vos iz dos far a,

252
00:15:30,094 --> 00:15:34,807
far a geve- ge- ORUDIEs?" dos iz nit, zeyere.

253
00:15:34,807 --> 00:15:38,680
hot er avekgeshikt a mototsikl. veyst vos iz a mototsikl?

254
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,165
es fort a mototsikl.

255
00:15:40,165 --> 00:15:43,436
iz bay zey geven mototsiklen mit a vegele.

256
00:15:43,594 --> 00:15:48,957
farshteyst? ot do hot er a mototsikl aza, un faran ot aza, dos iz a, a vegele,

257
00:15:48,957 --> 00:15:51,150
 dos iz der mototsiklist,

258
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:54,810
un do iz, zitst a pulemyotshik mit a pulemyot.

259
00:15:54,900 --> 00:15:59,350
farshteyst? hot er geshikt a kuk ton ver iz dos, oyf undz.

260
00:15:59,743 --> 00:16:02,420
makht tsu mir der traktorist vos zitst in zayt,

261
00:16:02,562 --> 00:16:04,660
zogt er, "TOVARISHCH STARSHIY LEYTENANT,"

262
00:16:04,660 --> 00:16:07,230
"khaver, elterer leytenant,

263
00:16:07,506 --> 00:16:10,706
gib a kuk: es fort tsu undz a RAZVEDCHIK."

264
00:16:11,978 --> 00:16:13,367
hob ikh opgeshtelt

265
00:16:13,367 --> 00:16:15,535
dem ershtn traktor, UNK opgeshtelt ⟨der⟩ tsveyt⟨er⟩,

266
00:16:15,535 --> 00:16:18,738
un ikh hob gegebn a komande, er vet unterforn aher noent,

267
00:16:18,846 --> 00:16:22,890
zol men, shi- ⟨⟩,

268
00:16:23,757 --> 00:16:25,118
UNICHTOZHen zey,

269
00:16:26,338 --> 00:16:29,190
tseshisn. azoy iz geven.

270
00:16:29,477 --> 00:16:30,871
mir hobn zey tseshosn

271
00:16:31,738 --> 00:16:34,540
fun, fun gever.

272
00:16:35,772 --> 00:16:40,052
kurts geredt, kh'hob geheysn UNK gikh di ORUDIEs fanandernemen,

273
00:16:40,699 --> 00:16:44,690
vorem es hot ongehoybn fun, fun magistral,

274
00:16:45,137 --> 00:16:47,341
fun HIGHWAY forn oyf undz

275
00:16:47,905 --> 00:16:50,734
mashinen mit soldatn a sakh doytsh.

276
00:16:51,583 --> 00:16:53,636
⟨vest nit⟩ antloyfn shoyn fun zey.

277
00:16:53,743 --> 00:16:59,272
zey zaynen azoy vi, zaynen azoy vi layz, zaynen azoy vi KOMARes vos baysn dir.

278
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:03,450
azoy hob ikh geheysn "gikh!"

279
00:17:03,514 --> 00:17:06,191
hobn mir ongehoybn shisn in zeyere,

280
00:17:06,870 --> 00:17:11,520
in zeyere AVTO mit di soldatn. in zeyere AVTO.

281
00:17:11,614 --> 00:17:15,890
ot iz an AVTO. es fort... ⟨kh'vel dir⟩ bavayzn vos s'iz an AVTO.

282
00:17:16,137 --> 00:17:19,500
oto, oto, zest? oto.

283
00:17:19,500 --> 00:17:21,311
ot do shisn soldatn,

284
00:17:22,212 --> 00:17:23,803
ot do iz di kabine

285
00:17:23,803 --> 00:17:25,968
mit dem o- ofitser mit zeyern.

286
00:17:26,041 --> 00:17:29,124
oto ⟨f-⟩ zitsn zey mit gever. farshteyst?

287
00:17:29,164 --> 00:17:32,930
hobn mir tseklapt dray AVTO velkhe zaynen aropgegangen fun veg.

288
00:17:32,930 --> 00:17:35,790
s'iz nokh ge- gut geven vos s'iz nit geven keyn tanken.

289
00:17:37,416 --> 00:17:40,937
hob ikh geheysn az mir hobn ot dos tseklapt un eyne, di ferte,

290
00:17:41,010 --> 00:17:44,171
hot glaykh aropgeshprungen di soldatn zeyere

291
00:17:44,171 --> 00:17:47,210
un me hot ongehoybn loyfn tsu undz.

292
00:17:47,727 --> 00:17:49,526
nor bay undz iz geven gever.

293
00:17:49,735 --> 00:17:52,749
di hobn zikh tseleygt, di soldatn ⟨vos hobn⟩ gehat gever.

294
00:17:52,890 --> 00:17:57,270
shoyn di SNARYADn iz bay undz kimat shoyn nito, nor hot shoyn keyn vert nit a SNARYAD far zey, far

295
00:17:57,270 --> 00:17:59,671
yeder soldat⟨, vest dokh nit sh-⟩ shisn mit ot dos,

296
00:17:59,671 --> 00:18:02,064
⟨ho-⟩ mit a, mit a SNARYAD.

297
00:18:02,458 --> 00:18:06,530
kitser, mir hobn zey opgeklapt. zaynen zey avekgepoyzet gevorn.

298
00:18:06,745 --> 00:18:11,800
far der tsayt hobn mir di, undzere pushkes,

299
00:18:11,976 --> 00:18:14,417
undzere pushkes, tsugetshepet,

300
00:18:14,878 --> 00:18:19,372
tsugetshepet tsu, t- tsu di t-, tsum tra- tsum traktor,

301
00:18:19,372 --> 00:18:22,490
tsu di traktorn tsvey, un mir zaynen antlofn gevorn.

302
00:18:22,490 --> 00:18:24,642
mir hobn shoyn di, dos nit gedarft hobn,

303
00:18:24,868 --> 00:18:27,089
nor oyb mir veln dos lozn,

304
00:18:27,518 --> 00:18:30,532
iz veln zey farshteyn az mir hobn keyn SNARYADn nit,

305
00:18:30,589 --> 00:18:34,582
vet men undz nemen mit, hoyle hent. hob ikh geheysn fartshepen dos,

306
00:18:34,740 --> 00:18:37,771
un mir zaynen avekgeforn. durkhgeforn farbay a dorf,

307
00:18:37,879 --> 00:18:39,729
hobn mir aropgenumen di toyte,

308
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:42,665
geheysn dem ZAMPREDSEDAT⟨ELYA⟩ KOLKHOZA,

309
00:18:42,874 --> 00:18:44,488
er zol zey bahaltn,

310
00:18:44,916 --> 00:18:49,500
un di farvundete. un ikh hob gelozn

311
00:18:51,310 --> 00:18:53,161
mer eyder a helft mentshn

312
00:18:53,927 --> 00:18:57,210
un dem komandir Adaskin. Adaskin iz a yid.

313
00:18:57,387 --> 00:19:02,360
ikh hob im gezogt, "her a mayse:, ikh vel mit di traktores

314
00:19:02,803 --> 00:19:05,058
avekforn ahin in feld.

315
00:19:05,149 --> 00:19:07,657
dortn vakst kukuruze,"

316
00:19:08,558 --> 00:19:09,649
zog ikh,

317
00:19:10,178 --> 00:19:16,750
"un es iz faran, fun dem zayt kukuruze, fun danen korn vakst, veyts,

318
00:19:17,012 --> 00:19:20,540
vel ikh araynforn aher in deroyf o,

319
00:19:20,809 --> 00:19:22,473
un di traktoristn

320
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:26,737
veln avekshteln shteyner oyf di"... dos, oyf,

321
00:19:26,737 --> 00:19:32,837
, me lozt dem gaz, veyst, az me kvetsht, oyfn gaz kvetsht men mitn fus, fort dos...

322
00:19:32,837 --> 00:19:36,092
"avekleygn shteyner. mir veln aroysshpringen

323
00:19:37,363 --> 00:19:41,542
in di k- in di kustn, in di o, in, vos mir zeen fun der vaytn,

324
00:19:41,937 --> 00:19:43,652
un zol dos forn aleyn,

325
00:19:43,708 --> 00:19:48,292
vorem der NEMETS vet nit lozn; er vet oy- oyf gevis

326
00:19:48,332 --> 00:19:50,722
vet er onlozn oyf undz di flier."

327
00:19:50,779 --> 00:19:52,511
ikh hob oyf deroyf gevart.

328
00:19:52,618 --> 00:19:56,712
un mir hobn ge- geforn oyf der PREDEL'Ner gikhkeyt.

329
00:19:58,710 --> 00:20:06,090
ikh hob gelozn in gantsn oto do o fir mentshn, DOBROVOL'TSes:

330
00:20:06,979 --> 00:20:13,300
a traktorist, eynem oyf dem traktor, a traktorist oyfn tsveytn, un

331
00:20:13,392 --> 00:20:17,318
eynem hob ikh gelozn in KUZOV do, un a tsveytn oto do o, me zol zen,

332
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:20,456
SLUCHAЕ CHEGO epes, epes zen.

333
00:20:21,154 --> 00:20:28,380
mir hobn nit u- uspeyet, M- M- MY NE USPELI, mir hobn nit dergreykht

334
00:20:28,461 --> 00:20:31,065
tsu der baheltenish avu mir hobn gekent lozn

335
00:20:31,065 --> 00:20:32,808
di traktorn aleyn forn,

336
00:20:33,085 --> 00:20:35,981
vi s'iz ongefloygn zeks

337
00:20:37,067 --> 00:20:41,270
SAMOLЁTn, zeks flier zeyere.

338
00:20:44,230 --> 00:20:46,748
hobn zey undz farvorfn mit bombes.

339
00:20:48,897 --> 00:20:55,306
mir zaynen pravde aroysgelofn, mir hobn gelo- -lofn in feld, vorem oyb a bombe ⟨popadet⟩ in, in traktor,

340
00:20:55,306 --> 00:21:00,780
iz do iz dokh faran OIL... nit keyn benzin; s'iz geven oyf OIL... rayst dos oyfet.

341
00:21:00,912 --> 00:21:03,909
UNK oyfraysn nokh a greserer oyfrays un dos o.

342
00:21:04,692 --> 00:21:08,330
 ikh, az ikh hob zikh oyfgekh-... ikh bin arayngefaln

343
00:21:08,337 --> 00:21:14,051
in a bombe, in a, in a l- in a gribl, in a grub vos di bombe hot oyfgerisn.

344
00:21:15,154 --> 00:21:18,388
zey hobn azoy niderik geflien, ikh hob gezen zeyere tsures.

345
00:21:19,727 --> 00:21:25,048
MESSER-..., nit keyn MESSERSCHMITTn. ⟨kh'hob fargesn⟩ vi zey rufn zikh ⟨sh-⟩ KAK RAZ itster hob ikh zikh fargesn.

346
00:21:25,048 --> 00:21:31,027
iber a UNK bisl tsayt ⟨vel ikh⟩, dermonen zikh vi es ruft zikh der, der flier...

347
00:21:31,945 --> 00:21:34,571
az ikh hob zikh oyfgekhapt,

348
00:21:35,185 --> 00:21:38,770
TO EST' lig ikh nit in grub,

349
00:21:39,555 --> 00:21:41,492
ikh bin geven apetushet.

350
00:21:41,492 --> 00:21:44,159
ikh bin geven, vi me zogt dos oyf rusish,

351
00:21:44,159 --> 00:21:45,726
YA BYL KONTUZHEN.

352
00:21:46,120 --> 00:21:48,780
ikh hob farlorn mayn farshtand.

353
00:21:49,478 --> 00:21:52,087
az ikh hob zikh oyfgekhapt, ⟨iz do⟩ bay mir,

354
00:21:52,583 --> 00:21:55,412
fun noz geyt blut, ikh her nit,

355
00:21:55,806 --> 00:22:01,260
nor ikh ze: lebn mir shteyen, tsvey soldatn, eyner a traktorist

356
00:22:01,260 --> 00:22:03,422
un der tsveyter a soldat,

357
00:22:03,422 --> 00:22:06,966
un es iz nito mayn portupey, nito mayn nagan, nito gornisht.

358
00:22:06,966 --> 00:22:11,250
in, do in di keshenes iz bay mir geven mayne dokumentn.

359
00:22:11,803 --> 00:22:19,006
alts nito. m'hot mir arumgenumen alts, di pasn, alts⟨,⟩ tsugenumen, nor ikh lig in, mayn, UNK kostyum.

360
00:22:19,006 --> 00:22:20,269
kurts geredt,

361
00:22:20,882 --> 00:22:23,840
dernokh dem untergegangen di vos hobn undz genumen

362
00:22:23,840 --> 00:22:27,740
in plen. ikh hob derzen az undz hot gekhapt in plen hobn undz gekhapt,

363
00:22:27,740 --> 00:22:30,710
 Ruminer, Ruminer soldatn.

364
00:22:31,125 --> 00:22:33,667
hot er ge- er hot geheysn

365
00:22:33,792 --> 00:22:38,700
mir oyfheybn, un m'hot undz a- un zey hobn mir untergehaltn ⟨in⟩ di, unter di hent.

366
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:41,194
m'hot undz gebrakht in a dorf PAVLOVKA,

367
00:22:41,537 --> 00:22:42,999
gebrakht tsu traybn.

368
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:45,733
VSЁ. ikh bin shoyn in zeyere hent.

369
00:22:46,144 --> 00:22:49,530
kurts geredt ⟨zikh⟩, dortn iz shoyn a sakh gefangene,

370
00:22:49,823 --> 00:22:53,880
in a sod, in a groysn sod geven, a sakh gefangene,

371
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:59,240
un ikh ze gor keyn, keyn vakh zol shteyn azoy un me zol hitn, keyner, ot azoy o, nor

372
00:22:59,240 --> 00:23:02,472
a sakh gefangene, un eynike ⟨g-⟩ geyen gor aleyn

373
00:23:03,205 --> 00:23:07,063
SD-, SDAVAen zikh in plen.

374
00:23:07,423 --> 00:23:09,847
me halt a PORTYANKe un me geyt.

375
00:23:11,338 --> 00:23:13,407
dos iz, a yid volt dos keyn mol nit ton.

376
00:23:14,477 --> 00:23:18,400
kurts geredt, hot zikh ayngetshepet eyner tsu mir

377
00:23:18,949 --> 00:23:21,406
un er zogt az ikh bin a yid.

378
00:23:22,797 --> 00:23:25,609
"TY," zogt er... er zogt nit "yid"... "TY ZHID."

379
00:23:27,066 --> 00:23:31,320
"ZHID." "ZHID" in Rusland, az me zogt oyf a yidn, dos iz

380
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:34,970
erger fun alts. Stalin hot gegebn dray yor far deroyf.

381
00:23:35,537 --> 00:23:37,741
Stalin hot aleyn gedarft hargenen dem yidn,

382
00:23:38,018 --> 00:23:43,460
nor eyner dem andern, far deroyf flegt er shlogn. farshteyst?

383
00:23:44,076 --> 00:23:51,140
iz, "TY ZHID. ETO ZHID, ZHID, ZHID!" oyf mir, un fartik. ikh hob gelegn; mir iz geven shver tsu oyfshteyn.

384
00:23:52,227 --> 00:23:54,341
dernokh dem iz er avekgelofn...

385
00:23:54,341 --> 00:23:56,422
hobn mayne soldatn tsvey

386
00:23:56,952 --> 00:23:58,802
nit gelozn mir nemen.

387
00:23:59,955 --> 00:24:04,454
nemt er un loyft aveket. s'iz geshtanen a Ukrayner ⟨h-⟩ shtub,

388
00:24:04,917 --> 00:24:07,847
a vayse, azoy vi ikh gedenk itster o, in sod.

389
00:24:08,038 --> 00:24:10,192
iz kumt er tsu geyn mit eynem

390
00:24:10,266 --> 00:24:13,210
a serzhant a ruminem,

391
00:24:13,590 --> 00:24:15,271
un me vayzt oyf mir.

392
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:19,367
nemt men... un er iz geven in tsivile zakhn

393
00:24:19,367 --> 00:24:22,126
mit a opgesherter kop, UNK ikh hob farshtanen az,

394
00:24:22,126 --> 00:24:25,582
 zey hobn fun a turem, fun a tyurme,

395
00:24:25,673 --> 00:24:28,586
dos iz UGOLOVNIKes, dos iz banditn.

396
00:24:29,419 --> 00:24:33,547
un er hot zey ayngeredt, un me traybt mir shisn in feld.

397
00:24:34,093 --> 00:24:39,251
hot men mir avekgetribn in feld. er shtupt mir. ikh, kam vos ikh gey, un er shtupt mir. ikh UNK getrakht,

398
00:24:40,287 --> 00:24:43,200
"an ek, a sof! alts eyns vet men mir hargenen."

399
00:24:43,813 --> 00:24:48,228
iz er avekgelofn zukhn avuhin tsu mir araynvarfn.

400
00:24:49,180 --> 00:24:52,324
un er hot ongehoybn makhn mitn hant, me zol geyn,

401
00:24:52,324 --> 00:24:54,017
me zol traybn mir tsu im.

402
00:24:54,495 --> 00:24:58,620
dortn iz geshtanen a grub fun a bombe.

403
00:24:59,203 --> 00:25:00,851
hot er gebrakht ahin o.

404
00:25:01,363 --> 00:25:08,709
un es darf zayn, dos iz a got-zakh. ikh trakht az s'iz a got-zakh, vorem ikh, az ikh dermon zikh ale mayne mayses, vos mit mir iz geven,

405
00:25:08,709 --> 00:25:13,180
iz dos zeyer a zeltn zakh. mit vemen ikh hob nor nit bagegnt zikh,

406
00:25:13,180 --> 00:25:17,202
mit velkhn gefangenem vos iz geven, iz bay im nit geven azoy.

407
00:25:17,547 --> 00:25:20,781
nit geven! a anderer iz geven nit gemalt

408
00:25:20,972 --> 00:25:27,330
un er hot gevust, er iz geven in Gruzye, hot er gevust GRUZINSKIY. Gruziner zaynen oykh nit gemalt.

409
00:25:27,452 --> 00:25:32,410
di zaynen geven in, in Uzbekistan, in Azerbaydzhan. zey zaynen gemalte,

410
00:25:32,410 --> 00:25:37,750
nor er hot dortn gelebt, iz er oykhet a gemalter, un er veys zeyer shprakh.

411
00:25:37,881 --> 00:25:41,800
farshteyst? un ikh nit. ikh bin fun Belarusye;

412
00:25:41,897 --> 00:25:46,430
ikh bin opgeteylt, ikh bin a gem- -alter, ikh veys keyn sh⟨um⟩ shprakh nit!

413
00:25:47,871 --> 00:25:54,170
kurts geredt, er hot, ZNACHIT, dem ge- di biks... di, di soldatn hobn nit gevolt shisn in mir,

414
00:25:54,170 --> 00:25:58,570
hot er aroysgekhapt bay eynem a soldat di biks un heybt shoyn oyf mir.

415
00:25:59,278 --> 00:26:03,590
in mitn drinen ⟨hot men mir⟩ gepakt farn aksl

416
00:26:03,590 --> 00:26:06,157
un me shlept mir oyf kerik. es darf dokh trefn,

417
00:26:06,838 --> 00:26:11,570
es iz ongeforn a NEMETSKe mashine...

418
00:26:12,424 --> 00:26:14,522
a NEMETSKe, ikh ruf zey on NEMETSKe.

419
00:26:14,522 --> 00:26:20,270
bay di Ruminer iz geven velkhe NEMETSKe, a LEGKOVAYA, ZHUKI. oft treft men do oykhet.

420
00:26:20,270 --> 00:26:22,492
ot azoy k- kumt zi oyset, di mashine...

421
00:26:22,870 --> 00:26:26,560
farshteyst? es geyt aroys a Ruminer ofitser,

422
00:26:27,578 --> 00:26:31,280
un fregt zikh, "V CH- V CHЁM DELO?" "vos iz far a mayse?"

423
00:26:31,577 --> 00:26:37,130
dertseylt im der soldat az der hot ayngeredt

424
00:26:37,130 --> 00:26:39,368
dem yefreytor, me zol undz hargenen,

425
00:26:39,964 --> 00:26:43,190
zol mir hargenen, zol... ikh bin a JUD.

426
00:26:44,149 --> 00:26:48,040
zogt er azoy tsu mir oyf rusish, makht er,

427
00:26:48,570 --> 00:26:53,002
"RUMYNY EVREEV NE UBIVAYUT. MY NE NEMTSY."

428
00:26:54,072 --> 00:26:58,080
er zogt. "NO ZAPOMNI ODNO:

429
00:26:58,577 --> 00:27:00,461
ESLI TY NE UDERЁSH',

430
00:27:01,412 --> 00:27:05,860
MY," zogt er, "OTDAЁM VOENNOPLENNYKH NEMTSAM.

431
00:27:06,036 --> 00:27:07,852
NEMTSY TEBYA UB'YUT."

432
00:27:08,989 --> 00:27:10,555
vos hot er gezogt? heyst dos,

433
00:27:10,555 --> 00:27:13,860
"mir ruminen hargenen nit keyn, keyn yidn.

434
00:27:14,760 --> 00:27:19,631
nor vos? mir muzn opgebn di VOENNOPLENNe di NEMTSes.

435
00:27:21,375 --> 00:27:24,980
me vet opgebn dir di NEMTSes, di NEMTSes veln dir hargenen.

436
00:27:26,320 --> 00:27:28,558
oyb du vest kenen antloyfn, antloyf.

437
00:27:28,581 --> 00:27:32,490
nor vi du geyst..." er zet az ikh gey, kam vos ikh gey...

438
00:27:32,884 --> 00:27:36,000
"firt im opet," zogt er, "in dos o, in, in dorf."

439
00:27:36,681 --> 00:27:40,387
az m'hot mir gebrakht in dorf, zaynen shoyn ale VOENNOPLENNe geven

440
00:27:41,102 --> 00:27:44,650
in a shtal, a groyse shtal geven, a KOLKHOZNe...

441
00:27:44,650 --> 00:27:46,546
s'iz geven in Rusland kolkhozn.

442
00:27:46,823 --> 00:27:50,361
do iz a fermer, dortn iz kolkhozn... ⟨zaynen mir⟩ geven in shtal.

443
00:27:51,008 --> 00:27:52,774
kitser, kh'hob dortn gelegn.

444
00:27:53,033 --> 00:27:56,132
a bisl hob ikh shoyn ongehoybn hern beser.

445
00:27:56,644 --> 00:28:01,650
hob ikh ongehoybn aynreydn mayne tsvey s-, soldatn az me zol makhn a lokh

446
00:28:01,943 --> 00:28:05,750
in der VETKHer, K-, KRYSHe, in der,

447
00:28:06,060 --> 00:28:09,840
VOT, un aroyskrikhn UNK bay der nakht.

